# Compiled build artifacts
/target

# rustfmt backup files
**/*.rs.bk

# Cargo.lock is intentionally committed: libcpg pins its full dependency graph
# for reproducible builds (and as a downstream `path` dependency of pgmcp).

# Nested build artifacts for the vendored grammar shim (its tests are run
# standalone from that directory, which creates its own target dir).
vendor/*/target
